{"ref":"BDB, קַר²","hw":"קַר²","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">קַר</span></big>  <strong>adj. cool</strong>;—cstr. (fig.) <span dir=\"rtl\">וְקַר־רוּחַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 17:27\" href=\"/Proverbs.17.27\">Pr 17:27</a> (Kt) <em>cool of spirit</em>, i.e. calm, self-possessed (Qr <span dir=\"rtl\">יְקַר־</span>); pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">קָרִים</span> of water <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 18:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.18.14\">Je 18:14</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 25:25\" href=\"/Proverbs.25.25\">Pr 25:25</a>.","next":"BDB, קֹר","prev":"BDB, קָרַר"}